---
title: Factories, essence, and the End
pageSlug: factories
modpack: sc-final-adventure-machines
section: gameplay
order: 2
---

Machines asks you to hunt bosses, farm their essence, and spend that essence in factories.

**Hunt.** Cataclysm and related bosses are resource nodes as much as set pieces. Learn each fight; the drops feed later recipes.

**Farm.** Easy Mob Farm and Create New Age turn those drops into a steady essence supply. Automate early so you are not hand-feeding every craft.

**Build.** Create and Mekanism cover logistics, processing, and power. Custom pack recipes keep the line pointed at adventure goals instead of infinite sandbox tech.

**Reach the End.** The portal is a Mechanical Crafting goal. Treat it as a capstone of the factory, not a dimension you stumble into. Relics and boss-driven recipes sit on that same path.
